{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7670910149318904091","title":"芯片设计工程师-SOC方向","description":"1、参与高性能SoC芯片的架构分析、系统设计与开发落地，构建高效的片上系统底座；\n2、负责SoC顶层集成或关键子模块的设计，根据产品需求制定清晰的模块设计规格与详细设计方案；\n3、完成高质量的RTL代码编写，执行Lint、CDC等代码质量检查与预综合，输出准确的时序规范（Timing Spec）；\n4、结合产品实际需求，在Chiplet片间互联、先进处理器微架构等前沿技术领域开展技术探索与方案预研；\n5、持续跟踪并研究业界前沿技术进展与行业标准，驱动团队技术储备与创新。","requirement":"1、微电子、集成电路、电子信息、通信工程、计算机等相关专业，本科及以上学历；\n2、熟练掌握Verilog等硬件描述语言，具备扎实的代码编写能力；\n3、具备良好的数字电路基础，熟悉异步设计、状态机、FIFO、时钟复位、缓存管理等典型电路设计；\n4、积极主动，认真严谨，具备良好的逻辑思维、沟通表达能力和跨团队协作精神。","city_info":{"code":"CT_155","name":"西安","en_name":"Xi'an","i18n_name":"西安"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1786023140120,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7659311908839262514","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘计划","i18n":"2027届校园招聘计划"},"limit_count":2,"active_status":1},"job_function":{"id":"7178830559051874412","name":"硬件研发类","en_name":"Hardware R\u0026D","i18n_name":"硬件研发类"},"job_id":"7670910149318723867","city_list":[{"code":"CT_155","name":"西安","en_name":"Xi'an","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"西安","py_name":"xian","mdm_code":"MDCY00000395","node_status":1},{"code":"CT_125","name":"上海","en_name":"Shanghai","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"上海","py_name":"shanghai","mdm_code":"MDCY00000002","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_li